WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.480
Stop scrolling. Our planet is not lost. Rivers are healing. Forests are rising. Oceans are being cleaned.

2
00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:12.880
83 real solutions and real people behind every one. Because saving a planet is saving us.

3
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:14.560
Watch what's working.

4
00:00:21.520 --> 00:00:26.480
Breathe in. Half the oxygen on Earth comes from tiny ocean plankton.

5
00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:35.920
A new NASA telescope, a million miles out, sees a hundred times more sky than Hubble, and may find over 100,000 worlds.

6
00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:52.960
Liftoff. Every launch now carries hope. Eyes in orbit watch hurricanes, wildfires and rising seas so families get warned in time. Follow every launch, live.

7
00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:56.800
We go to space to protect the only home we have.

8
00:00:59.760 --> 00:01:07.280
We don't have to save the whole world. One river. One reef. One tree. Donate. Volunteer. Join in.

9
00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:12.640
Every fact here is sourced from NASA, NOAA and ESA. Saving a planet is saving people.

10
00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:18.080
Follow Saving Planets.

